\f1  (optional but recommended) | Once the AI returns the JSON, you can load it into your existing Phaser game (the `bitiverse.html` file) to instantly populate the world. Then the agent can navigate to each building and the Boss (user) can assign tasks related to these locations. **Proceed to generate Bitsburg now** \'96 paste the prompt into your cloud model and watch your first AI city come to life.\
